  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "I am Lily. Today we go to Grandma's house. I have a big bag. Tom has a bag too. We look at my clothes. I have a blue jacket. I have two white shirts. I have a pink hat.",
      "My jeans are black. My socks are pink. My boots are red. They are new. \"Wear your boots,\" says Mom. \"The garden is dirty.\" I wear my red boots. I put the pink hat in my bag.",
      "Tom has a gray robot. It is small. Tom has a long train. It is green. I have a brown teddy. It is old. \"Is a teddy for a baby?\" asks Tom. \"No!\" I say. \"My teddy is my friend.\" Tom smiles. Now we have our toys and clothes. \"Let's go!\" says Mom."
    ],
    "summary": "Lily and Tom go to Grandma's house. Lily tells us about the clothes and toys in their bags.",
